{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q418224","formula":"C₁₅H₁₀O₇","hill":"C15H10O7","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":10.0,"O":7.0},"names":{"en":"Morin","ru":"Морин (краситель)"},"descriptions":{"en":"Morin is a yellow chemical compound that can be isolated from Maclura pomifera (Osage orange), Maclura tinctoria (old fustic), and from leaves of Psidium guajava (common guava). In a preclinical in vitro study, morin was found to be a weak inhibitor of fatty acid synthase with an IC50 of 2.33 μM. Morin was also found to inhibit amyloid formation by islet amyloid polypeptide (or amylin) and disaggregate amyloid fibers. Morin can be used to test for the presence of aluminium or tin in a solution, since it forms characteristically fluorescent coordination complexes with them under UV light.","ru":"Мори́н (3,5,7,2′,4′-пентагидроксифлавол) — органическое соединение, природный флавонол с химической формулой C15H10O7. Жёлтый оксифлавоновый краситель, получаемый из красильного тутового дерева (лат. Maclura tinctoria) и применяющийся в аналитической химии и микроскопии для определения тория, бериллия, алюминия и других элементов."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":5281670,"mass":302.23,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC(=C(C=C1O)O)C2=C(C(=O)C3=C(C=C(C=C3O2)O)O)O","inchikey":"YXOLAZRVSSWPPT-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2-(2,4-dihydroxyphenyl)-3,5,7-trihydroxychromen-4-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5281670","atoms":32,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.214,"y":-0.888,"z":0.094,"el":"O"},{"x":0.892,"y":2.628,"z":0.092,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.27,"y":1.765,"z":0.015,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.882,"y":2.83,"z":0.052,"el":"O"},{"x":2.134,"y":-0.075,"z":-2.257,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.475,"y":-2.979,"z":0.016,"el":"O"},{"x":6.081,"y":-0.858,"z":0.289,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.209,"y":0.494,"z":0.056,"e